Z||000009||pherder||12-13-2001||05:04 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Hartz:<BR><B>That is nice.  I like the color.  What is it?<P>I thought elfiero's car had a 5.0L?  Am I mistaken (likely) or is the 383 a new development?<P>Very cool car.<P>Hartz</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>IAW elfiero and 383GT it is House of Kolor Lime Green.<P>I have been in email contact with Eric (383GT) and he is the second owner after elfiero.  The PO supposely had TPIS redo the engine.  I told Eric where to look on the block to see if indeed he has a 5.0 or 5.7 block (casted into the block by GM).<P>You can see more pictures/info @<BR> <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/fiero383" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/fiero383</A> <P>Paul||||reg||1
Z||000010||lowfierogt||12-13-2001||06:22 PM||||You got jacked.   SS,  I hate to be mean in all.  I have to tell you the story about that car.   One its a 305 and its rigged.   Half a$$ work and halfa$$ parts, junk yard parts.<P>Nice paint and wheels.<P>Good luck<P>sell the getrag<P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://lowfierogt.no-ip.com/lowfierogtsig.gif">         <BR>http://lowfierogt.no-ip.com<BR>86 1/2 GT<BR>85 GT Project, fastback V8<BR>87 coupe Getting V6 daily driver over 300k miles||||reg||1
Z||000011||KEV||12-14-2001||07:26 PM||||Hi 383gt I was there when that car was being built, the dealer you bought the car from are blowing smoke up your butt, telling you it's a 383. NOT it's a 87-88 305 205hp&270toq. from a camaro from the junk yard and so was the tranny, he only installed new gaskets on the engine. The car org. had a auto in it, he switch it after that tranny went out. I drove the car when it had that tranny, not bad.Does the car have the Trans Am power seats? The front springs were cut to lower the car, The car didn't have a sunroof, we changed the roof skins but the upper corners cracked and had them puttied. I'm just letting you know what was done on the car that you bought. If you need to know anything e-mail me. Go luck <P>------------------<BR>BLACK85GT 3800V6 2"DROP, FLUSHMOUNT HEADLIGHTS AND WRAPAROUND WING, 17' WHEELS ON FRONT 18'ON REAR||||reg||1
